  "method": {
    "action_equivalence": "Native Qwen25 parsed ordered tool-call sequence and arguments;  sorted JSON keys, integral floats normalized; ignores candidate thoughts, JSON formatting within accepted tool wrappers and non-tool prose. Exact argument strings and coordinates are retained. This is not DOM target equivalence or verified executability.",
    "weighting": "Mean across panels within task, then equal-weight mean across tasks with at least one observed panel. Tasks with no candidate panels excluded from diversity means and reported explicitly.",
    "uncertainty": "10000 percentile task bootstrap replicates, seed 20261008; within-panel differences computed before task averaging. Descriptive exploratory intervals, no multiplicity correction.",
    "malformed": "No native parsed tool-call or nonobject arguments excluded from unique counts and valid-pair denominators; reported separately. Known-tool/schema diagnostics do not modify primary parseability.",
    "same_state": "Within each saved N10 panel compare first 3, first 5 and all 10 generated candidates. This is an offline subset analysis at N10-visited states; not a rerun with N3 or N5 selection.",
    "subset_expectation": "Exact mean distinct count over every k-of-10 subset: sum_a [1-C(10-count(a),k)/C(10,k)]. A finite-panel descriptive quantity, requiring no iid/exchangeability claim.",
    "selection_novelty": "Whether the selected N10 parsed action is absent from the first k candidates, among panels with parseable selected action; does not imply the selector would choose a different action when shown k candidates.",
    "sensitivity": "collapse_done merges all done arguments; grid25/grid50 additionally bins point_2d in 25/50 actor-coordinate units. These are proxies, not semantic element matching. All other arguments remain exact. executor additionally fills consumed defaults and removes ignored fields from known tools according to frozen web_env; executor_collapse_done also merges terminal wording. Invalid inputs remain unnormalized.",
    "cross_run": "Actual N3/N5/N10 episodes visit different states; N5 was collected earlier. Equal task IDs do not establish matched decision states.",
    "seed_limitation": "Recorded candidate request seeds verified against hash derivation; frozen protocol says FlashInfer ignores request seeds, so no deterministic cross-run reproduction claim."
  },
